{"title":"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> is a real number, then the quantity <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/8/d2868f12ec0e7ae986e5fb5306fd6b2b43c1cdcc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1-|x|)(1+x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"120\" height=\"18\" /> is positive if and only if\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/f/deff33d5658a1606268f73116872954a2db7f75e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }|x|&lt;1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }|x|&gt;1\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }x&lt;-1\\text{ or }-1&lt;x&lt;1\\qquad\\\\ \\textbf{(D) }x&lt;1\\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }x&lt;-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"461\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We divide our solution into three cases: that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d269c9f239f1b12cce2c56a46feb219eca6247a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bda5706a3ac4b451919dc932d49cb10141e359e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />, and that of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />. (When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, the expression is zero, therefore not positive.)\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d269c9f239f1b12cce2c56a46feb219eca6247a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />, then the first <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Factor\" title=\"Factor\">factor</a> is negative, and the second factor is also negative.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bda5706a3ac4b451919dc932d49cb10141e359e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />, then the first factor is positive, and the second factor is also positive.\n</p><p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/6/3767f0665ea4d5f0e9c58452fc5782b42a8a65a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &gt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, the first factor is negative, but the second factor is positive.\n</p><p>Combining this with the rules for signs and multiplication, we find that the expression is positive when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/6/d269c9f239f1b12cce2c56a46feb219eca6247a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x &lt; -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/d/6bda5706a3ac4b451919dc932d49cb10141e359e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-1 &lt; x &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"90\" height=\"12\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" /> and we are done.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME\" title=\"1976 AHSME\">1976 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1976 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1976\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1976_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1976 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-fil